  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/02/IMG_4086.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px;\">(248 fotos) El equipo Green Go! ha ganado este domingo 7-6 a Guindillas en el segundo partido de la VI liga de improvisaci&oacute;n teatral de Onda, con lo que queda empatado a 2 puntos con Humor amarillo, que gan&oacute; el primer match a Azu-lejos.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3720.jpg\" alt=\"img_3720\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3721.jpg\" alt=\"img_3721\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3722.jpg\" alt=\"img_3722\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3723.jpg\" alt=\"img_3723\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3724.jpg\" alt=\"img_3724\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3725.jpg\" alt=\"img_3725\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3727.jpg\" alt=\"img_3727\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3729.jpg\" alt=\"img_3729\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2onpartitvilligaimpro18/img_3732.jpg\" alt=\"img_3732\" style=\"max-wi